      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Maybe we can get a series of options as well?\n\nAll, New/Relative, None, Funny.\n\nAll - What it currently is.\n\nNew/Relative - Only new or relative tips released as part of TOS related updates such as “Don’t share your login info with others.”\n\nNone - No tips will be shown. We are free!\n\nFunny - Inside jokes of the community and gaming at large. Such as: \n\n“Press the Jump button to Jump!”\n\nWARNING! Only works in worlds where Jumping is enabled. \n\n“Get VRC+ Now!”\n\n(Only shown to those with an active VRC+ subscription. Purchased or Gifted)\n\n“Enter Portals or pick a world from the World menu to visit somewhere else!”\n\n(You’re literally doing this.)\n\n——\n\nThe OP’s idea of letting you dismiss a tip that you seen should also be added. \n\n“Do not show this again\"",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
